                      (   unit_tests.asm):00967         ; unit test for ?DUP ( n -- n n | 0 ), nonzero case.
                      (   unit_tests.asm):00968         ; Verifies the nonzero value is duplicated, the guard
                      (   unit_tests.asm):00969         ; beneath is undisturbed, and exactly one cell was added -
                      (   unit_tests.asm):00970         ; same as DUP's own behavior for this case. ?DUP needs two
                      (   unit_tests.asm):00971         ; tests, one per condition, since DUP-like and no-op are
