                      (   unit_tests.asm):01805         ; unit test for R@. Moves a value to the return stack via
                      (   unit_tests.asm):01806         ; >R, peeks it via R@ (verifying the copy matches), then
                      (   unit_tests.asm):01807         ; retrieves the original via R> (verifying R@ genuinely left
                      (   unit_tests.asm):01808         ; it there undisturbed, not just that R@ itself returned the
                      (   unit_tests.asm):01809         ; right value once) - confirming "non-destructive" for real,
                      (   unit_tests.asm):01810         ; not assumed from the name.
                      (   unit_tests.asm):01811         ; TSTRFETCH
