                      (   unit_tests.asm):08644         ; unit test for DEFER, default-action case. Compiles "DEFER
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08645         ; TESTWD" into scratch, then executes it via CATCH. Verifies
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08646         ; the default action throws -21 (per DEFER's own documented
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08647         ; behavior before IS/DEFER! sets a real target) and that
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08648         ; CATCH's own depth-restoration contract holds - same
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08649         ; pattern as the divide-by-zero tests in earlier sections.
