                      (   unit_tests.asm):08753         ; unit test for DEFER together with DEFER!/DEFER@. Compiles
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08754         ; "DEFER TESTWD", sets its target to DUP's own xt via DEFER!
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08755         ; (an ordinary runtime word - unlike DEFER's own name-
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08756         ; parsing, DEFER!/DEFER@ take an xt-defer directly, no
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08757         ; WORD/FIND needed), executes TESTWD (should now behave like
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08758         ; DUP), then reads the target back via DEFER@ to confirm it
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08759         ; matches.
