E7D0 DC08             (    forth6809.asm):04041                     LDD   CODEHERE
E7D2 3606             (    forth6809.asm):04042                     PSHU  D
E7D4 DC46             (    forth6809.asm):04043                     LDD   NEWFLD
E7D6 3606             (    forth6809.asm):04044                     PSHU  D
