E894 3706             (    forth6809.asm):04200         PLOOPOK:    PULU  D                 ; dest
E896 3606             (    forth6809.asm):04201                     PSHU  D                 ; park dest. See bugfix: PLUSLOOPW.1
E898 CCE8D0           (    forth6809.asm):04202                     LDD   #DOPLUSTEST
E89B 3606             (    forth6809.asm):04203                     PSHU  D
