E8C0 260D             (    forth6809.asm):04219                     BNE   PLOOPDONE
E8C2 3706             (    forth6809.asm):04220                     PULU  D
E8C4 3710             (    forth6809.asm):04221                     PULU  X                 ; ?DO skip operand
