EE0F DD66             (    forth6809.asm):05284                     STD   DIVREM
EE11 0C63             (    forth6809.asm):05285                     INC   DIVNUM+1
EE13 0A68             (    forth6809.asm):05286         UDSKIP:     DEC   DIVCNT
